        "outcome_value": -1.0,
        "outcome_unit": "pp",
        "outcome_zh": "Q2 同样 −1pp，但持续时间更长；公司称若剔除中东，Q2 集团有机增速是 +4% 而不是 +3%。季末「still negative but much more muted」。",
        "verdict": "met"
